    <statement><p>Combine radicals, if possible.  Simplify your 
answer as much as possible.</p>
<p><m>\sqrt[3]{3 x} + 8 \sqrt[3]{3 x} - 4 \sqrt[3]{3 x}</m> = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>5\mathopen{}\left(3x\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
